{{!
  JPA entity, separate from the domain type. Exemplar: account-adapter SalesRegionEntity.
  The key, one of:
    (none)        a database-generated serial Long id.
    naturalKey    one @Id column, e.g. a caller-assigned UUID id ({type: UUID, name: id, column: id}) or a text code.
                  With a typed id (domain/id), type is UUID and typedId names the domain id type: the entity stores its
                  value().
    compositeKey  several @Id columns by @IdClass, with a nested record Key; mark the last item with last.
  organisationColumn: the column holding the row's organisation (org_id, organisation_id), mapped to the field
  organisationId that the repository templates query; the domain type does not carry it, the port passes it in.
  Omit it for a table without one (reference data, users, organisations themselves).
  fromDomain: adds a <Name>Entity([OrganisationId, ]<Name>) constructor, needed by default-repository-crud (which also
  needs organisationColumn). Combine it with a key, otherwise every save of a rebuilt entity INSERTs a new row.
  A field is NOT NULL unless it sets nullable; readOnly maps a column the database fills (generated, default now()).
  A new table needs a Flyway migration: that is a STOP item, get a human decision first.
  Target: <capability>-adapter/src/main/java/<package path>/adapter/repository/<Name>Entity.java
  Package: "package" is the base package, without the ".adapter.repository" this template appends (com.example.guest
          renders package com.example.guest.adapter.repository); <package path> is that base as a path.
          scripts/scaffold.sh refuses a target outside the directory of the package the file declares.
  Vars:   package, basePackage (root holding common/), Name, table, organisationColumn (optional), fromDomain (bool),
          naturalKey (optional: type, name, pascal, column, typedId (optional, domain id type)),
          compositeKey (optional: [type, name, pascal, column, last]),
          fields[type, name, pascal, column, nullable (bool), readOnly (bool)]  (non-key columns; pascal only needed
          with fromDomain)
}}
